      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new iridoid, named torricellate, was isolated from root bark of Torricellia angulata var intermedia, a Chinese folk medicinal plant used to treat bone fracture, tonsillitis and asthma. Its structure was elucidated by NMR, MS, IR and UV, and confirmed by X-ray diffraction studies."},
